#. module: pos_payment_method_fee
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_payment_method_fee.field_pos_payment_method__use_transaction_fees
msgid ""
"Compute and post the financial cost (acquirer or gateway fees) of the "
"payments made with this method. Only available for payment methods with a "
"bank journal. Disabling it only affects new payments: fees already computed "
"are kept and posted."
msgstr ""
"Calcular y registrar el costo financiero (comisiones del adquirente o del "
"gateway) de los pagos realizados con este método. Solo disponible para "
"métodos de pago con un diario bancario. Desactivarlo solo afecta a los nuevos pagos: las comisiones ya calculadas se mantienen y se registran."

